# scripts/opcount: `readerbench bench value N` reads a Map of four
# numbers N times as a json.Value by json.Decode (JSON-CURSOR-ALLOC): each
# member's key and each Num's digits are the Value's own copies (stdlib.md
# json 2). The control is hand Go: encoding/json into any, numbers as
# json.Number.
unit read
sizes 20000 120000
args bench value {n}
control benchmarks/wirereaders/testdata/control
